<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38204" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπανθ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>deck as with flowers, make bright-coloured,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τινὶ ἐρύθημα</span>
			<i>give</i> one a red <i>tint,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Hist. Conscr.</u>
				13
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλέφαντα ἐ. τῷ χρυσῷ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				51
			</span></i>; <i>brighten, give lustre to</i> a dye, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHolm.</u>
				17.9
			</span></i>, al.:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρώμασιν ἐπηνθισμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					1.49
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>deck as with flowers, decorate, adorn,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωκυτοῖς ἐ. παιᾶνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					150
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλοῖς ἐ. πόνοισι γενεάν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Th.</u>
					949
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαγγελία ἐπηνθισμένη ὀνόμασι
					ποιητικοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VS</u>
					1.15.4
				</span></i>
			.—The aor.
			
				Med.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπηνθίσω</span> is prob. corrupt in <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1459
			</span></i> (lyr.).</div>
